WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.085
Week 32: Work, Technology, and Formal Communication. summarize a meeting write a professional message explain a technical problem and next action

2
00:00:10.085 --> 00:00:18.249
Form and meaning. Reported speech; reciprocal constructions; stressed possessives; formal connectors and nominal style.

3
00:00:18.249 --> 00:00:49.691
Model set. Según la técnica, la red ya funciona. Nos comunicamos por un canal seguro. El director dijo que ampliarían el plazo. Adjunto encontrará el informe solicitado. Con respecto al incidente, faltan dos datos. According to the technician, the network is already working. We communicate through a secure channel. The director said they would extend the deadline. Attached you will find the requested report. Regarding the incident, two pieces of information are missing.

4
00:00:49.691 --> 00:00:59.843
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:59.843 --> 00:01:13.685
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: summarize a meeting; write a professional message; explain a technical problem and next action. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:13.685 --> 00:01:45.873
Model language. Según la técnica, la red ya funciona. — According to the technician, the network is already working. Nos comunicamos por un canal seguro. — We communicate through a secure channel. El director dijo que ampliarían el plazo. — The director said they would extend the deadline. Adjunto encontrará el informe solicitado. — Attached you will find the requested report. Con respecto al incidente, faltan dos datos. — Regarding the incident, two pieces of information are missing.

7
00:01:45.873 --> 00:01:55.771
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
